Add Valve's QControllerEvent extension to Qt 6, extracted from the Steam Link
Flatpak's qtbase patch and rebased on 6.11.1:

  https://github.com/flathub/com.valvesoftware.SteamLink
  patches/steamlink/qtbase.patch

The prebuilt steamlink binary references QControllerEvent and the
QWidget::controllerEvent() virtual, neither of which exist upstream. Only the
controller event hunks are kept; the tvOS, virtual platform plugin and
unrelated fixes from the original patch are dropped.

Note that this inserts a virtual into QWidget, so the resulting libraries are
NOT ABI compatible with a stock Qt build and must stay in a private directory.

